<title>USA: Female Health names Mark Osborn CFO.</title>
<headline>Female Health names Mark Osborn CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Female Health Co said it named Mark Osborn to the post of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He was previously a vice president with Venture Stores Inc, Female Health said.  </p>
<p>Osborn fills a post that had been handled by an outside, temporary executive, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
